{"id":"memorial_105104","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial105100","label":"Call Logs · Looking for the Giant.txt"},"label":"Temporarily Saved Note.txt","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_105103","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_105104_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"What's that?"},{"id":"memorial_105104_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"Those are definitely human limbs."},{"id":"memorial_105104_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"Have there ever been Raptures that look like this?"},{"id":"memorial_105104_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"But... they're all so different."},{"id":"memorial_105104_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"Some have human arms, some have human legs..."},{"id":"memorial_105104_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"and some have multiple eyes."},{"id":"memorial_105104_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"Nikke? Rapture? Heretic?"},{"id":"memorial_105104_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"A chimera fused from the two?"},{"id":"memorial_105104_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"Or a completely new species?"},{"id":"memorial_105104_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"Ugh... disgusting."},{"id":"memorial_105104_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"Disgusting, disgusting, disgusting, disgusting!"},{"id":"memorial_105104_12","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"Wait, it saw us!"},{"id":"memorial_105104_13","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_04_description","text":"It's coming"}]}